abstract: >-
  Firmware, host tools, hardware schematic and latency dataset for FidoLock,
  an ESP32 door controller that acts as a self-contained FIDO2 relying party
  for hardware security keys over NFC (CTAP2).
keywords:
  - FIDO2
  - CTAP2
  - physical access control
  - ESP32
  - NFC
  - hardware security keys
